## Files

- Create `src/jobs/weekly-csat-summary.js` — the job.
- Create `test/weekly-csat-summary.test.js` — its tests, in its own file because `export-tickets.test.js` already
  sets the precedent of giving a file-writing job its own test file (tmp-dir setup) rather than folding it into
